{%- comment -%}
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  OTODOR Module: Service Form  (post-sale intake — complaint OR registration)
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Purpose:            Give an existing customer one place to reach a human
                      about a product they already own — by native email
                      (Shopify `contact` form) or instantly on WhatsApp with
                      the same details already typed into the message.

  TWO JOBS, ONE SECTION. The file is still named `otodor-complaint-form`
  (renaming it would break the templates that reference the type), but it
  serves both post-sale intakes, because they differ only in which fields
  are asked for:

    Complaint     issue blocks present, serial label blank
                  → `page.complaint`, Request type "Complaint"
    Registration  issue blocks absent (the select drops itself), serial
                  label set and required
                  → `page.warranty-registration`, Request type
                    "Warranty registration"

  The hidden `Request type` field is what separates them in the merchant's
  inbox. Duplicating 300 lines to change three labels would have been the
  more expensive mistake.
  Primary source:     Section settings + `issue` / `model` / `promise` blocks.
                      A complaint desk is config-driven, not metafield-driven.
  Fallback order:     issue blocks   → free-text description only;
                      model blocks   → free-text "product" field;
                      promise blocks → omit the left assurance list;
                      channel settings blank → that channel row drops.
  Visibility rule:    Always renders (a complaint desk is never "empty"); every
                      sub-part self-hides when it has nothing to show.
  Merchant editable:  YES — all copy, labels, issue categories, model list,
                      assurances, direct channels, colour scheme, WhatsApp.
  Required metafields: none.
  Optional metafields: none. Reads settings.otodor_whatsapp_number /
                      _enabled for the WhatsApp path.
  Dependencies:       snippets/otodor-icon.liquid; otodor-base.css tokens.
                      Native `{% form 'contact' %}` — submissions arrive at the
                      store's contact/notification email (Settings →
                      Notifications). No backend, no app.
  Preset:             Full desk — 3 assurances, 6 issue categories, 5 models,
                      WhatsApp + phone + email channels. Renders live.
  Accessibility:      <section aria-labelledby>, <label> per control, radios in
                      a <fieldset>/<legend>, aria-required on required fields,
                      error aria-describedby, visible focus, success panel
                      tabindex=-1 autofocus (Dawn parity).
  Reusable for:       Complaint page, warranty-claim page, service-request page,
                      installation-issue page — one section, different copy.

  THE WHATSAPP PATH IS THE SAME COMPLAINT, NOT A "CONTACT US" LINK. The
  button's href is rebuilt on every keystroke from the fields the visitor has
  filled, so tapping it opens WhatsApp with the order number, model, issue
  category and description already written out. The static href (built in
  Liquid) is the no-JS fallback.
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign scheme = section.settings.color_scheme | default: 'light'
  assign anchor = section.settings.anchor_id | default: 'otodor-complaint' | handle
  assign complaint_form_id = 'otodor-complaint-form-' | append: section.id

  assign issue_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'issue'
  assign model_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'model'
  assign promise_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'promise'

  # ── WhatsApp path ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  assign wa_enabled = false
  if section.settings.show_whatsapp and settings.otodor_whatsapp_enabled and settings.otodor_whatsapp_number != blank
    assign wa_enabled = true
    assign wa_number = settings.otodor_whatsapp_number
    assign wa_intro = section.settings.whatsapp_message | default: 'Hello OTODOR, I would like to raise a complaint.'
    assign wa_text = wa_intro | url_encode
    assign wa_link = 'https://wa.me/' | append: wa_number | append: '?text=' | append: wa_text
  endif

  # ── Direct channels (each row drops when blank) ────────────────────────
  assign phone_number = section.settings.support_phone
  assign support_email = section.settings.support_email
-%}

{%- style -%}
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} {
    padding-block: {{ section.settings.padding_top | default: 96 }}px {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | default: 96 }}px;
    scroll-margin-top: 90px;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }}.otodor-cmp--light { background: var(--otodor-bg-light); color: var(--otodor-ink); --cmp-accent: var(--otodor-accent-on-light); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }}.otodor-cmp--dark  { background: var(--otodor-black); color: var(--otodor-white); --cmp-accent: var(--otodor-blue); }

  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__inner {
    max-width: var(--otodor-container);
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: clamp(1.75rem, 6vw, 2.75rem); }
  }

  /* ─ Left rail ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__eyebrow {
    display: block; font-family: var(--otodor-font-display); font-size: 0.96rem; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: var(--otodor-tracking-widest); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; color: var(--cmp-accent);
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__title {
    font-family: var(--otodor-font-display); font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: var(--otodor-tracking-tight); margin: 0;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }}.otodor-cmp--light .otodor-cmp__title { color: var(--otodor-ink); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }}.otodor-cmp--dark  .otodor-cmp__title { color: var(--otodor-white); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__title .accent { color: var(--cmp-accent); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__sub { margin: 1rem 0 0; font-size: 1.34rem; line-height: 1.55; opacity: 0.66; max-width: 34rem; }

  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__promises { list-style: none; margin: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem) 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__promise { display: flex; gap: 0.85rem; align-items: flex-start; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__promise-icon {
    flex: 0 0 auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: var(--otodor-radius-md); color: var(--cmp-accent);
  }
  .otodor-cmp--light .otodor-cmp__promise-icon { background: rgba(26,120,216,0.08); }
  .otodor-cmp--dark  .otodor-cmp__promise-icon { background: rgba(77,166,255,0.12); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__promise-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__promise-title { font-family: var(--otodor-font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.25rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__promise-text { margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.5; opacity: 0.6; }

  /* ─ Direct channels ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__channels {
    margin-top: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); display: grid; gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__channels-label {
    font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.55;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__channel {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;
    font-size: 1.22rem; font-weight: 600; width: fit-content;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; transition: border-color var(--otodor-dur-fast) ease;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__channel:hover { border-bottom-color: currentColor; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__channel svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; color: var(--cmp-accent); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__channel--wa svg { color: #25D366; }

  /* ─ Right panel (the form card) ───────────────────────────── */
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__panel {
    border-radius: var(--otodor-radius-lg); padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
  }
  .otodor-cmp--light .otodor-cmp__panel { background: var(--otodor-bg-light-2); border: 1px solid var(--otodor-hairline-light); box-shadow: var(--otodor-shadow-md); }
  .otodor-cmp--dark  .otodor-cmp__panel { background: var(--otodor-surface); border: 1px solid var(--otodor-hairline); }

  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__form { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__field { display: grid; gap: 0.4rem; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__label { font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.01em; opacity: 0.85; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__label .req { color: var(--cmp-accent); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__hint { font-size: 0.98rem; opacity: 0.55; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__input,
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__select,
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__textarea {
    width: 100%; font-family: var(--otodor-font-body); font-size: 1.22rem; color: inherit;
    padding: 0.72rem 0.9rem; border-radius: var(--otodor-radius-md); border: 1px solid; background: transparent;
    transition: border-color var(--otodor-dur-fast) ease, box-shadow var(--otodor-dur-fast) ease;
  }
  .otodor-cmp--light .otodor-cmp__input,
  .otodor-cmp--light .otodor-cmp__select,
  .otodor-cmp--light .otodor-cmp__textarea { border-color: var(--otodor-hairline-light-2); background: #fff; }
  .otodor-cmp--dark .otodor-cmp__input,
  .otodor-cmp--dark .otodor-cmp__select,
  .otodor-cmp--dark .otodor-cmp__textarea { border-color: var(--otodor-hairline-mid); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 120px; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__input:focus-visible,
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__select:focus-visible,
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__textarea:focus-visible {
    outline: none; border-color: var(--cmp-accent); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--otodor-blue-glow);
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__select { appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; cursor: pointer; }

  /* ─ Preferred contact (radio pills) ───────────────────────── */
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__fieldset { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.4rem; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__legend { font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight: 600; opacity: 0.85; padding: 0; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__pill {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: var(--otodor-radius-pill); border: 1px solid;
    font-size: 1.09rem; font-weight: 600; min-height: 44px;
    transition: border-color var(--otodor-dur-fast) ease, background var(--otodor-dur-fast) ease;
  }
  .otodor-cmp--light .otodor-cmp__pill { border-color: var(--otodor-hairline-light-2); background: #fff; }
  .otodor-cmp--dark  .otodor-cmp__pill { border-color: var(--otodor-hairline-mid); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__pill input { accent-color: var(--cmp-accent); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__pill:has(input:checked) { border-color: var(--cmp-accent); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__pill:focus-within { outline: 2px solid var(--cmp-accent); outline-offset: 2px; }

  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__consent { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; align-items: flex-start; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.45; opacity: 0.72; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__consent input { margin-top: 0.2rem; accent-color: var(--cmp-accent); flex: 0 0 auto; }

  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0.35rem; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__submit {
    flex: 1 1 auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; border: none; cursor: pointer; border-radius: var(--otodor-radius-pill);
    font-family: var(--otodor-font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.22rem; min-height: 44px;
    background: var(--cmp-accent); color: #fff;
    transition: transform var(--otodor-dur-fast) ease, filter var(--otodor-dur-fast) ease;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__submit:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); filter: brightness(1.05); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__submit svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__wa {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.2rem; border-radius: var(--otodor-radius-pill); text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--otodor-font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.15rem; min-height: 44px;
    background: #25D366; color: #05300f;
    transition: transform var(--otodor-dur-fast) ease;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__wa:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__wa svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__note { margin: 0.35rem 0 0; font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.5; opacity: 0.55; }

  /* ─ Success + error states ────────────────────────────────── */
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__success {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem) 1rem;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__success-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(37,211,102,0.14); color: #25D366;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__success-badge svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__success-title { font-family: var(--otodor-font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.73rem; margin: 0; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__success-text { margin: 0; font-size: 1.22rem; line-height: 1.55; opacity: 0.66; max-width: 26rem; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__errors {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem; border-radius: var(--otodor-radius-md);
    background: rgba(220,38,38,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(220,38,38,0.28); font-size: 1.09rem;
  }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__errors ul { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; }
  #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__field-error { color: #dc2626; font-size: 1rem; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__submit,
    #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__wa { transition: none; }
    #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__submit:hover,
    #otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }} .otodor-cmp__wa:hover { transform: none; }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<section
  id="otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }}"
  class="otodor-cmp otodor-cmp--{{ scheme }}"
  data-otodor-section="complaint-form"
  aria-labelledby="otodor-cmp-title-{{ section.id }}"
>
  <span id="{{ anchor }}" class="otodor-cmp__anchor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="otodor-cmp__inner">

    {%- comment -%} ── Left rail: assurances + direct channels ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="otodor-cmp__aside" data-otodor-reveal="fade-up">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <span class="otodor-cmp__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <h2 class="otodor-cmp__title" id="otodor-cmp-title-{{ section.id }}">
        {{ section.settings.heading | escape }}{% if section.settings.heading_accent != blank %} <span class="accent">{{ section.settings.heading_accent | escape }}</span>{% endif %}
      </h2>
      {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
        <p class="otodor-cmp__sub">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if promise_blocks.size > 0 -%}
        <ul class="otodor-cmp__promises" role="list">
          {%- for block in promise_blocks -%}
            <li class="otodor-cmp__promise" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- if block.settings.icon != blank -%}
                <span class="otodor-cmp__promise-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'otodor-icon', name: block.settings.icon %}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span>
                {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}<span class="otodor-cmp__promise-title">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}<p class="otodor-cmp__promise-text">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if wa_enabled or phone_number != blank or support_email != blank -%}
        <div class="otodor-cmp__channels">
          {%- if section.settings.channels_label != blank -%}
            <span class="otodor-cmp__channels-label">{{ section.settings.channels_label | escape }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if wa_enabled -%}
            <a class="otodor-cmp__channel otodor-cmp__channel--wa" href="{{ wa_link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span aria-hidden="true">{% render 'otodor-icon', name: 'smart' %}</span>
              {{ section.settings.whatsapp_label | escape }}
              <span class="visually-hidden">(opens WhatsApp)</span>
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if phone_number != blank -%}
            <a class="otodor-cmp__channel" href="tel:{{ phone_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '-' }}">
              <span aria-hidden="true">{% render 'otodor-icon', name: 'app' %}</span>
              {{ phone_number | escape }}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if support_email != blank -%}
            <a class="otodor-cmp__channel" href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">
              <span aria-hidden="true">{% render 'otodor-icon', name: 'log' %}</span>
              {{ support_email | escape }}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ── Right panel: the native contact form ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="otodor-cmp__panel" data-otodor-reveal="fade-up">
      {%- form 'contact', id: complaint_form_id, class: 'otodor-cmp__form' -%}
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          <div class="otodor-cmp__success" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
            <span class="otodor-cmp__success-badge" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'otodor-icon', name: 'warranty' %}</span>
            <h3 class="otodor-cmp__success-title">{{ section.settings.success_title | escape }}</h3>
            <p class="otodor-cmp__success-text">{{ section.settings.success_text | escape }}</p>
            {%- if wa_enabled -%}
              <a class="otodor-cmp__wa" href="{{ wa_link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <span aria-hidden="true">{% render 'otodor-icon', name: 'smart' %}</span>
                {{ section.settings.whatsapp_label | escape }}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          {%- if form.errors -%}
            <div class="otodor-cmp__errors" role="alert" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
              {{ 'templates.contact.form.error_heading' | t }}
              <ul>
                {%- for field in form.errors -%}
                  <li>{{ form.errors.translated_fields[field] | capitalize }} {{ form.errors.messages[field] }}</li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%}
            Hidden context — arrives as labelled lines in the contact email, so a
            complaint is filterable and attributed without any app.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[Request type]" value="{{ section.settings.request_type | default: 'Complaint' | escape }}">
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[Source page]" value="{{ canonical_url | escape }}">

          <div class="otodor-cmp__row">
            <div class="otodor-cmp__field">
              <label class="otodor-cmp__label" for="otodor-cmp-name-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.label_name | escape }} <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <input class="otodor-cmp__input" type="text" id="otodor-cmp-name-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Name]" autocomplete="name"
                required aria-required="true"
                value="{% if form.name %}{{ form.name | escape }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.name | escape }}{% endif %}">
            </div>
            <div class="otodor-cmp__field">
              <label class="otodor-cmp__label" for="otodor-cmp-phone-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.label_phone | escape }} <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <input class="otodor-cmp__input" type="tel" id="otodor-cmp-phone-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Phone]" autocomplete="tel"
                inputmode="tel" required aria-required="true"
                value="{% if customer %}{{ customer.phone | escape }}{% endif %}">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="otodor-cmp__field">
            <label class="otodor-cmp__label" for="otodor-cmp-email-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.label_email | escape }} <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input class="otodor-cmp__input" type="email" id="otodor-cmp-email-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[email]"
              autocomplete="email" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" required aria-required="true"
              {% if form.errors contains 'email' %}aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="otodor-cmp-email-error-{{ section.id }}"{% endif %}
              value="{% if form.email %}{{ form.email | escape }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.email | escape }}{% endif %}">
            {%- if form.errors contains 'email' -%}
              <small class="otodor-cmp__field-error" id="otodor-cmp-email-error-{{ section.id }}">{{ form.errors.translated_fields.email | capitalize }} {{ form.errors.messages.email }}</small>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>

          <div class="otodor-cmp__row">
            <div class="otodor-cmp__field">
              <label class="otodor-cmp__label" for="otodor-cmp-order-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.label_order | escape }}</label>
              <input class="otodor-cmp__input" type="text" id="otodor-cmp-order-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Order number]"
                inputmode="text" placeholder="{{ section.settings.order_placeholder | escape }}">
            </div>
            <div class="otodor-cmp__field">
              <label class="otodor-cmp__label" for="otodor-cmp-date-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.label_date | escape }}</label>
              <input class="otodor-cmp__input" type="date" id="otodor-cmp-date-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Purchase date]">
            </div>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%}
            Serial number: blank label = no field. A complaint rarely needs it;
            a warranty registration is worthless without it, which is the whole
            difference between this form's two jobs.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if section.settings.label_serial != blank -%}
            <div class="otodor-cmp__field">
              <label class="otodor-cmp__label" for="otodor-cmp-serial-{{ section.id }}">
                {{ section.settings.label_serial | escape }}
                {%- if section.settings.serial_required %} <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span>{% endif -%}
              </label>
              <input class="otodor-cmp__input" type="text" id="otodor-cmp-serial-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Serial number]"
                inputmode="text" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false"
                {% if section.settings.serial_required %}required aria-required="true"{% endif %}
                placeholder="{{ section.settings.serial_placeholder | escape }}">
              {%- if section.settings.serial_hint != blank -%}
                <span class="otodor-cmp__hint">{{ section.settings.serial_hint | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="otodor-cmp__field">
            <label class="otodor-cmp__label" for="otodor-cmp-product-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.label_product | escape }}</label>
            {%- if model_blocks.size > 0 -%}
              <select class="otodor-cmp__select" id="otodor-cmp-product-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Product]" data-otodor-cmp-product>
                <option value="">{{ section.settings.product_placeholder | escape }}</option>
                {%- for block in model_blocks -%}
                  <option value="{{ block.settings.label | escape }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</option>
                {%- endfor -%}
                {%- if section.settings.product_other != blank -%}
                  <option value="{{ section.settings.product_other | escape }}">{{ section.settings.product_other | escape }}</option>
                {%- endif -%}
              </select>
            {%- else -%}
              <input class="otodor-cmp__input" type="text" id="otodor-cmp-product-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Product]"
                data-otodor-cmp-product placeholder="{{ section.settings.product_placeholder | escape }}">
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>

          {%- if issue_blocks.size > 0 -%}
            <div class="otodor-cmp__field">
              <label class="otodor-cmp__label" for="otodor-cmp-issue-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.label_issue | escape }} <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <select class="otodor-cmp__select" id="otodor-cmp-issue-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Issue]"
                required aria-required="true" data-otodor-cmp-issue>
                <option value="">{{ section.settings.issue_placeholder | escape }}</option>
                {%- for block in issue_blocks -%}
                  <option value="{{ block.settings.label | escape }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</option>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </select>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="otodor-cmp__field">
            <label class="otodor-cmp__label" for="otodor-cmp-body-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.label_message | escape }} <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <textarea class="otodor-cmp__textarea" id="otodor-cmp-body-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Comment]"
              required aria-required="true" data-otodor-cmp-message
              placeholder="{{ section.settings.message_placeholder | escape }}">{{ form.body }}</textarea>
            {%- if section.settings.message_hint != blank -%}
              <span class="otodor-cmp__hint">{{ section.settings.message_hint | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>

          {%- if section.settings.show_preferred -%}
            <fieldset class="otodor-cmp__fieldset">
              <legend class="otodor-cmp__legend">{{ section.settings.label_preferred | escape }}</legend>
              <div class="otodor-cmp__pills">
                {%- assign preferred_options = section.settings.preferred_options | default: 'Phone call, WhatsApp, Email' | split: ',' -%}
                {%- for option in preferred_options -%}
                  {%- assign option_label = option | strip -%}
                  {%- if option_label == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  <label class="otodor-cmp__pill" for="otodor-cmp-pref-{{ forloop.index }}-{{ section.id }}">
                    <input type="radio" id="otodor-cmp-pref-{{ forloop.index }}-{{ section.id }}"
                      name="contact[Preferred contact]" value="{{ option_label | escape }}"
                      {% if forloop.first %}checked{% endif %}>
                    <span>{{ option_label | escape }}</span>
                  </label>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </fieldset>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if section.settings.show_consent -%}
            <label class="otodor-cmp__consent" for="otodor-cmp-consent-{{ section.id }}">
              <input type="checkbox" id="otodor-cmp-consent-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Consent]" value="Yes"
                {% if section.settings.consent_required %}required aria-required="true"{% endif %}>
              <span>{{ section.settings.consent_text | escape }}</span>
            </label>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="otodor-cmp__actions">
            <button type="submit" class="otodor-cmp__submit">
              {{ section.settings.submit_label | escape }}
              <span aria-hidden="true">{% render 'otodor-icon', name: 'arrow-right' %}</span>
            </button>
            {%- if wa_enabled -%}
              <a class="otodor-cmp__wa" href="{{ wa_link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                aria-label="{{ section.settings.whatsapp_label | escape }} (opens WhatsApp)"
                data-otodor-cmp-wa
                data-wa-number="{{ wa_number | escape }}"
                data-wa-intro="{{ wa_intro | escape }}"
                data-l-name="{{ section.settings.label_name | escape }}"
                data-l-phone="{{ section.settings.label_phone | escape }}"
                data-l-email="{{ section.settings.label_email | escape }}"
                data-l-order="{{ section.settings.label_order | escape }}"
                data-l-serial="{{ section.settings.label_serial | escape }}"
                data-l-date="{{ section.settings.label_date | escape }}"
                data-l-product="{{ section.settings.label_product | escape }}"
                data-l-issue="{{ section.settings.label_issue | escape }}"
                data-l-message="{{ section.settings.label_message | escape }}"
                data-l-preferred="{{ section.settings.label_preferred | escape }}">
                <span aria-hidden="true">{% render 'otodor-icon', name: 'smart' %}</span>
                {{ section.settings.whatsapp_label | escape }}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          {%- if section.settings.form_note != blank -%}
            <p class="otodor-cmp__note">{{ section.settings.form_note | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endform -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%}
  The WhatsApp button carries the complaint, not a greeting: its href is rebuilt
  from the filled fields on every input/change. Progressive enhancement — the
  Liquid-built href already works without this script.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById('otodor-complaint-{{ section.id }}');
    if (!root) return;
    var wa = root.querySelector('[data-otodor-cmp-wa]');
    if (!wa) return;

    var num = wa.getAttribute('data-wa-number');
    var intro = wa.getAttribute('data-wa-intro') || '';
    var fields = [
      ['data-l-name', 'contact[Name]'],
      ['data-l-phone', 'contact[Phone]'],
      ['data-l-email', 'contact[email]'],
      ['data-l-order', 'contact[Order number]'],
      ['data-l-serial', 'contact[Serial number]'],
      ['data-l-date', 'contact[Purchase date]'],
      ['data-l-product', 'contact[Product]'],
      ['data-l-issue', 'contact[Issue]'],
      ['data-l-message', 'contact[Comment]'],
      ['data-l-preferred', 'contact[Preferred contact]']
    ];
    var clean = function (s) { return (s || '').replace(/\s*\*+\s*$/, '').replace(/\s*\(optional\)\s*$/i, '').trim(); };
    var valueOf = function (name) {
      var nodes = root.querySelectorAll('[name="' + name + '"]');
      if (!nodes.length) return '';
      for (var i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
        var el = nodes[i];
        if (el.type === 'radio' || el.type === 'checkbox') {
          if (el.checked) return el.value.trim();
        } else if (el.value) {
          return el.value.trim();
        }
      }
      return '';
    };
    var rebuild = function () {
      var lines = [];
      if (intro) lines.push(intro);
      fields.forEach(function (f) {
        var v = valueOf(f[1]);
        if (v) lines.push(clean(wa.getAttribute(f[0])) + ': ' + v);
      });
      wa.setAttribute('href', 'https://wa.me/' + num + '?text=' + encodeURIComponent(lines.join('\n')));
    };
    root.addEventListener('input', rebuild);
    root.addEventListener('change', rebuild);
    rebuild();
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "OTODOR Service Form",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopify-section otodor-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Post-sale complaint intake. Submissions arrive at your store's contact email (Settings → Notifications). The WhatsApp button opens a chat with the complaint already written out." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "anchor_id", "label": "Anchor id (for deep links)", "default": "otodor-complaint", "info": "Link to this page with #otodor-complaint to scroll straight to the form." },
    { "type": "select", "id": "color_scheme", "label": "Colour scheme", "options": [ { "value": "light", "label": "Light" }, { "value": "dark", "label": "Dark" } ], "default": "light" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "request_type", "label": "Request type (email label)", "default": "Complaint", "info": "Sent as a hidden field so complaints are easy to filter in your inbox." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Heading (left rail)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Customer care" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Raise a" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading_accent", "label": "Heading accent (coloured)", "default": "complaint." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "subheading", "label": "Subheading", "default": "Something not right with your OTODOR product or installation? Tell us what happened and a service engineer will take it from here." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Direct channels" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "channels_label", "label": "Channels label", "default": "Or reach us directly" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "support_phone", "label": "Support phone", "default": "+91 72068 95607", "info": "Leave blank to hide the phone row." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "support_email", "label": "Support email", "info": "Leave blank to hide the email row." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Form labels" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "label_name", "label": "Name label", "default": "Name" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "label_phone", "label": "Phone label", "default": "Phone" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "label_email", "label": "Email label", "default": "Email" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "label_order", "label": "Order number label", "default": "Order number (optional)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "order_placeholder", "label": "Order number placeholder", "default": "e.g. #1042" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "label_serial", "label": "Serial number label", "info": "Leave blank to hide the field. Required for warranty registration; usually unnecessary for a complaint." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "serial_required", "label": "Serial number is required", "default": false },
